            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jerry Oliver"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Awesome. I didn't drain the tomatoes. It wasn't quite tart enough. I added a bit more vinegar and juice from half a lime. I could just drink the dressing. I think it will be a GREAT marinade, too, Especially for fish or chicken!",
